---
/** Dismissible top strip. Dismissal persists per visitor via localStorage,
 *  keyed by the anno id so a new message re-shows for everyone. */
---

<div class="announce" id="announce" data-anno-id="1">
  <p>
    Free shipping on bags over $40 <span class="dot">·</span> New harvest
    single-origins just landed. <a href="/coffee/">Shop now →</a>
  </p>
  <button class="anno-close" aria-label="Dismiss announcement">×</button>
</div>
